+     *
+     * <p>The BFS expands as follows:
+     * <ul>
+     *   <li>depth 0 — atom 0 (CH3)</li>
+     *   <li>depth 1 — atom 1 (CH2)</li>
+     *   <li>depth 2 — atom 2 (aromatic C, ring carbon)</li>
